{
  "declaredLength": 3716,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "只要有樹果，\n什麼樣的甜甜圈我都會做！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898167096A39679CFF0C000A4EC09EBC6A237684751C751C5708621190FD6703505AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "樹果的搭配是決定滋味的關鍵，\n歡迎來到安馨兒的甜甜圈店！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6A39679C7684642D914D662F6C7A5B9A6ECB5473768495DC9375FF0C000A6B618FCE4F8652305B8999A851527684751C751C57085E97FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甜甜圈呢，有洞的話，\n油炸時會更容易受熱。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751C751C57085462FF0C67096D1E76848A71FF0C000A6CB970B86642670366F45BB9661353D771B130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果從甜甜圈的洞瞄瞄世界，\n不曉得會看到什麼呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C5F9E751C751C570876846D1E778477844E16754CFF0C000A4E0D66C95F976703770B52304EC09EBC5462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我啊，\n喜歡揉甜甜圈的麵團。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211554AFF0C000A559C6B6163C9751C751C570876849EB5571830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "無論是有發酵還是沒發酵，\n甜甜圈的口感都會改變。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "71218AD6662F6709767C91759084662F6C92767C9175FF0C000A751C751C5708768453E3611F90FD670365398B8A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這裡是旅館Ｚ的小小店鋪，\n安馨兒的甜甜圈店！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901988E1662F65C59928FF3A76845C0F5C0F5E9792EAFF0C000A5B8999A851527684751C751C57085E97FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是異次元密阿雷調查的關鍵人物安馨兒，\n這裡是我的甜甜圈店！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F75706B2151435BC6963F96F78ABF67E5768495DC93754EBA72695B8999A85152FF0C000A901988E1662F62117684751C751C57085E97FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這裡是胡帕喜歡的甜甜圈店中的第１名，\n安馨兒的甜甜圈店！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901988E1662F80E15E15559C6B617684751C751C57085E974E2D76847B2CFF11540DFF0C000A5B8999A851527684751C751C57085E97FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "安馨兒我的狀態好得不得了，\n所以什麼樣的甜甜圈都難不倒我。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8999A851526211768472C0614B597D5F974E0D5F974E86FF0C000A62404EE54EC09EBC6A237684751C751C570890FD96E34E0D5012621130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "歡迎光臨！請問幾位？\n……我試著模仿了一下壽司店。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B618FCE514981E8FF018ACB554F5E7E4F4DFF1F000A2026202662118A6684576A214EFF4E864E004E0B58FD53F85E9730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "阿羅拉地區的馬拉薩達\n也可以說是一種甜甜圈呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "963F7F8562C957305340768499AC62C985A99054000A4E5F53EF4EE58AAA662F4E007A2E751C751C5708546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓甜甜圈的圈圈，\n圈到全世界！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B93751C751C5708768457085708FF0C000A5708523051684E16754CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我已經做很多甜甜圈了，\n但我還想做更多更多！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662115DF27D93505A5F88591A751C751C57084E86FF0C000A4F466211908460F3505A66F4591A66F4591AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要做出能夠承受超級能的\n最棒的甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118981505A51FA80FD5920627F53D78D857D1A80FD7684000A670068D27684751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以使用４個樹果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE54F7F7528FF14500B6A39679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以使用５個樹果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE54F7F7528FF15500B6A39679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以使用６個樹果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE54F7F7528FF16500B6A39679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以使用７個樹果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE54F7F7528FF17500B6A39679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最多可以使用８個樹果！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700591A53EF4EE54F7F7528FF18500B6A39679CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣、鮮、甜、苦、酸，\n是哪一種味道呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA330019BAE3001751C300182E630019178FF0C000A662F54EA4E007A2E547390535462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳多多製作甜甜圈，\n多多進行調查吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3591A591A88FD4F5C751C751C5708FF0C000A591A591A9032884C8ABF67E55427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我先把奶油加熱，\n做成融化奶油！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115148628A59766CB952A071B1FF0C000A505A6210878D531659766CB9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先一口氣做很多甜甜圈的話，\n就不用回旅館Ｚ了喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51484E0053E36C23505A5F88591A751C751C570876848A71FF0C000A5C314E0D752856DE65C59928FF3A4E86559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "訣竅是要把樹果\n磨碎到口感滑順。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A237AC5662F8981628A6A39679C000A78E8788E523053E3611F6ED1980630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷的甜甜圈\n有滿滿的砂糖對吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F77684751C751C5708000A67096EFF6EFF768478027CD65C0D542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會用我的甜甜圈\n和胡帕的力量來協助<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳調查。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116703752862117684751C751C5708000A548C80E15E157684529B91CF4F86535452A900100003110000FF01014F6059B38ABF67E530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請找出如何搭配樹果\n來發揮<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳喜歡的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB627E51FA59824F55642D914D6A39679C000A4F86767C63EE00100003110000FF01014F6059B3559C6B6176846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甜甜圈的洞明明什麼都「沒有」，\n但被認為「有」洞，很有趣對吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751C751C570876846D1E660E660E4EC09EBC90FD300C6C926709300DFF0C000A4F4688AB8A8D70BA300C6709300D6D1EFF0C5F8867098DA35C0D542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來……\n異次元樹果真是神秘的樹果呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F8620262026000A75706B2151436A39679C771F662F795E79D876846A39679C546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "留意增幅等級\n也是很重要的喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7559610F589E5E457B497D1A000A4E5F662F5F8891CD89817684559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "飽腹能量太少的話，\n調查時間也會變少喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98FD817980FD91CF592A5C1176848A71FF0C000A8ABF67E5664295934E5F67038B8A5C11559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想做做看會讓人\n更容易遇見頭目的甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3505A505A770B67038B934EBA000A66F45BB966139047898B982D76EE7684751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "會讓人更容易遇見\n異色寶可夢的甜甜圈也不錯呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67038B934EBA66F45BB966139047898B000A757082725BF653EF59227684751C751C57084E5F4E0D932F546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "風味級別提升的話，\n甜甜圈的效果也會增強喔！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98A854737D1A522563D0534776848A71FF0C000A751C751C570876846548679C4E5F6703589E5F375594FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甜味的甜甜圈\n胡帕也會很高興的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751C54737684751C751C5708000A80E15E154E5F67035F889AD882087684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有預感，香甜的甜甜圈\n會很受異色寶可夢的歡迎。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167099810611FFF0C9999751C7684751C751C5708000A67035F8853D7757082725BF653EF592276846B618FCE30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我覺得香甜的甜甜圈\n能得到運氣相關的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189BA5F979999751C7684751C751C5708000A80FD5F975230904B6C2376F895DC76846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辛辣的咖哩甜甜圈\n很有旅館Ｚ的風格對吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F9B8FA37684549654E9751C751C5708000A5F88670965C59928FF3A768498A8683C5C0D5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣味會不會提升\n寶可夢的攻擊力呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA3547367034E0D670363D05347000A5BF653EF59227684653B64CA529B5462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我覺得辛辣的甜甜圈\n能得到對攻擊有利的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189BA5F978F9B8FA37684751C751C5708000A80FD5F9752305C0D653B64CA6709522976846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "酸味系的甜甜圈\n帶一點點酸味，胡帕也喜歡。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "917854737CFB7684751C751C5708000A5E364E009EDE9EDE91785473FF0C80E15E154E5F559C6B6130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請用會讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳更容易獲得樹果的甜甜圈，\n多多收集樹果吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB752867038B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B366F45BB9661373725F976A39679C7684751C751C5708FF0C000A591A591A653696C66A39679C5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果是酸酸的甜甜圈，\n好像能得到與道具有關的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C662F917891787684751C751C5708FF0C000A597D50CF80FD5F975230820790535177670995DC76846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別看胡帕這樣，\n牠也喜歡苦味的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5225770B80E15E1590196A23FF0C000A72604E5F559C6B6182E65473768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果能減少特定屬性的招式\n造成的傷害就好了呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C80FD6E1B5C1172795B9A5C6C6027768462DB5F0F000A90206210768450B75BB35C31597D4E86546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我覺得苦苦的甜甜圈\n能得到對防禦有利的效果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189BA5F9782E682E67684751C751C5708000A80FD5F9752305C0D963279A66709522976846548679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "新鮮滋味的甜甜圈\n會刺激胡帕的味覺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65B09BAE6ECB54737684751C751C5708000A6703523A6FC080E15E157684547389BA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想要捕捉寶可夢的時候，\n我推薦新鮮的甜甜圈喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F38981635563495BF653EF5922768466425019FF0C000A621163A885A665B09BAE7684751C751C5708559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果是新鮮的甜甜圈，\n好像能得到與捕獲相關的效果呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C662F65B09BAE7684751C751C5708FF0C000A597D50CF80FD5F97523082076355737276F895DC76846548679C546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甜甜圈會有什麼樣的效果？\n等做好之後就會知道了呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751C751C5708670367094EC09EBC6A2376846548679CFF1F000A7B49505A597D4E4B5F8C5C31670377E590534E865462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是為了超級甜甜圈大作戰準備的\n特別到不行的甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F70BA4E868D857D1A751C751C570859274F5C62306E9650997684000A7279522552304E0D884C7684751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "帶著有滿滿樹果的甜甜圈，\n去見固拉多吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E36845767096EFF6EFF6A39679C7684751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB898B56FA62C9591A5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "帶著用了大量樹果的甜甜圈，\n去見蓋歐卡吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E36845775284E86592791CF6A39679C7684751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB898B84CB6B5053615427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "帶著用了豐富樹果的甜甜圈，\n去見烈空坐吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E36845775284E868C505BCC6A39679C7684751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB898B70C87A7A57505427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有預感會做出\n最棒的等離子閃電甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167099810611F6703505A51FA000A670068D276847B4996E25B50958396FB751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳會不會為了做出\n奇特的甜甜圈而煩惱呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B367034E0D670370BA4E86505A51FA000A594772797684751C751C5708800C716960F15462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "無論怎麼樣搭配樹果，\n我都能做出甜甜圈給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "71218AD6600E9EBC6A23642D914D6A39679CFF0C000A621190FD80FD505A51FA751C751C57087D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在煩惱要做\n什麼樣的甜甜圈呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B35728716960F18981505A000A4EC09EBC6A237684751C751C5708546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "與其猶豫不決，\n不如多多製作甜甜圈吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8207517673368C6B4E0D6C7AFF0C000A4E0D5982591A591A88FD4F5C751C751C57085427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一動也不動耶。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B34E0052D54E5F4E0D52D5803630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳發呆的樣子也滿不錯的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3767C544676846A235B504E5F6EFF4E0D932F768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "製作甜甜圈這件事，\n就是在創造幸福。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88FD4F5C751C751C570890194EF64E8BFF0C000A5C31662F5728527590205E78798F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "製作甜甜圈重要的是\n遵守基礎和注入心意。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88FD4F5C751C751C570891CD89817684662F000A90755B8857FA790E548C6CE851655FC3610F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會拼了命地做出\n讓寶可夢覺得好吃的甜甜圈！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670362FC4E86547D5730505A51FA000A8B935BF653EF592289BA5F97597D54037684751C751C5708FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說可以從食物的喜好\n了解一個人。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA53EF4EE55F9E98DF72697684559C597D000A4E8689E34E00500B4EBA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟民以食為天嘛。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF6C114EE598DF70BA5929561B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "料理重要的是基礎。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6599740691CD89817684662F57FA790E30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳慢慢考慮吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3616261628003616E542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "慢慢來，慢慢來。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "616261624F86FF0C616261624F8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我崇拜的廚師，\n說起來算是那位志米先生。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115D0762DC76845EDA5E2BFF0C000A8AAA8D774F867B97662F90A34F4D5FD77C735148751F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    }
  ],
